# Population census spike (Phase 22, D-07): start in a quiet (government 7) system and
# dump the ship census. Same probe OXP and the same route as census-anarchy.steps:
#   run-remote.sh --steps tools/oolite-reference/steps/census-quiet.steps \
#     --addons /home/opencode/oolite-probes/population-census --out DIR --timeout 300
# The probe's scenarios.plist adds "Census anarchy (Qudira)" and "Census quiet
# (Teanrebi)" after the four built-ins. One key press moves the selection two rows
# (the 0.5 s hold repeats once; see census-anarchy.steps). The seven selectable rows
# wrap and start on Normal, so one Up press goes Normal -> Return to Menu -> the last
# row, "Census quiet (Teanrebi)".
window 120
sleep 10
shot title
key Return
sleep 3
shot scenarios
sleep 2
key Up
sleep 4
shot scenario-selected
key Return
waitlog 180 CENSUS-DONE
sleep 3
shot docked
